                                                                                                                                               "typeName":  "dsDescriptionValue",
                                                                                                                                               "multiple":  false,
                                                                                                                                               "typeClass":  "primitive",
                                                                                                                                               "value":  "This dataset contains data collected during the 2021 agricultural season for the Baix Ter case study (CS2). The irrigation strategies applied were similar to those used in 2020: wet seeding with continuous flooding (WFL), dry seeding with delayed flooding (DFL), and dry seeding with subsurface drip irrigation (SDI). As in the previous year, the SDI method was implemented in two pilot farms: Camp del Cobert and Benzinera, both located in Pals. The dataset also includes the experimental layouts of the pilot fields and the rice varieties cultivated under each irrigation treatment."
                                                                                                                                           },
